ards with notes, images, PDFs, links, web embeds. Arrange ideas spatially — perfect for research synthesis, literature mapping, project planning.- Pro workflow: Combine with Excalidraw → sketch on canvas → link notes → build full research environment 🎨 Graph View Enhanced — Network Visualization - Plugins like Graph Banner: Improve the core graph view — show it as a banner, customize colors by tag, filter, and navigate your knowledge network visually   ⚡ 6. AUTOMATION & PRODUCTIVITY — Eliminate Repetition Set it and forget it — Obsidian works for you, not the other way around. ⚡ Metadata Menu — Frontmatter Made Easy - What it does: Dropdowns, calendars, checkboxes, and auto-suggest for YAML fields. No more typing  status: in-progress  manually — select from a list.- Why it matters: Consistent metadata = better Dataview queries = better research organization ⚡ Meta Bind — Interactive Notes (Forms & Buttons) - What it does: Turn static Markdown into interactive forms — inputs, sliders, toggles, buttons — all bound directly to frontmatter. Build dashboards that update metadata live.- Example: Click a button → changes project status → Dataview dashboard updates automatically ⚡ Folder Note / Waypoint — Auto-Organized MOCs - What it does: Automatically creates and maintains index notes (Maps of Content) for every folder — lists all contained notes with links, descriptions, and previews. Never have stale folder indexes again. ⚡ Auto Note Mover — Rule-Based File Organization - What it does: Automatically moves notes into correct folders based on tags, title, or frontmatter patterns. Set rules once → your inbox organizes itself. ⚡ Tag Wrangler — Tag Management - What it does: Rename, merge, and refactor tags across your entire vault in one operation. No more broken or inconsistent tags.   🔄 7. SYNC, BACKUP & COLLABORATION — Safety Everywhere Beyond official Obsidian Sync — full control over your data. ☁️ Remotely Save — Cross-Platform Sync - What it does: Sync vault between 